      "id": "3joson9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "1. Meaning of Nutrition"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Nutrition encompasses the intake, breakdown, and biological utilization of food components by the body.",
        "Carbohydrates and fats serve as the primary energy sources, whereas proteins are vital for tissue growth and repair.",
        "Vitamins and minerals function as essential micronutrients needed for regulatory and protective functions.",
        "A balanced diet provides all essential nutrients in proper proportions to maintain optimal health.",
        "Malnutrition covers both undernutrition and overnutrition, leading to specific deficiency or excess disorders."
      ],
      "id": "nif33ov"
    },
